n the increased application load; the cost is recouped by avoiding massive EC2 scaling. Read replicas are omitted because they increase cost without improving RTO (failover is automatic via Multi-AZ) and are not required by N1–N6. Sustainability: The proposed design uses fewer total instance-hours over a month (4–10 t3.small instances vs. potential 19+ t3.micro instances) and more efficient arm64-compatible instance types for database (t3 instances use lower power consumption than older generations), reducing carbon footprint per request served.",
